# Fixtures: only the synthetic (fabricated) files are tracked. A real supplier
# PDF may be dropped in these directories for local testing against real data
# (see pricelistparser/tests/fixtures/README.md) - it must never be committed.
pricelistparser/tests/fixtures/**
!pricelistparser/tests/fixtures/
!pricelistparser/tests/fixtures/**/
!pricelistparser/tests/fixtures/**/README.md
!pricelistparser/tests/fixtures/**/generate_synthetic.py
!pricelistparser/tests/fixtures/**/synthetic.pdf
!pricelistparser/tests/fixtures/**/synthetic.expected.json
